# Everything the containers read must keep Unix line endings. A shell script with CRLF fails
# with "bad interpreter", and a checkout on Windows would otherwise produce exactly that.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.properties text eol=lf
*.template text eol=lf
